<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss palladium/platinum export data for May.</title>
<headline>Swiss palladium/platinum export data for May.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss exports of raw or powdered palladium stood at 3,146 kg in May, down from 4,312 kg in April and bringing the cumulative total for 1997 to 39,847 kg, the Federal Customs Office said.</p>
<p> (in kg)	   May 1997	    Jan-May 1997</p>
<p> Exports	    3,146		   39,847</p>
<p> Imports	    1,528		    4,346</p>
<p>The biggest receiver of Swiss palladium exports in May was the U.S., with 1,492 kg. It was also the biggest source of imports, with 914 kg.</p>
<p>Platinum, raw or powdered:</p>
<p> (in kg)	   May 1997	    Jan-May 1997</p>
<p> Exports	   13,720		   27,819</p>
<p> Imports		663		    7,069</p>
<p>The biggest receiver of Swiss platinum exports in May was Italy, with 11,094 kg. The biggest source of imports was South Africa, with 376 kg.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
